      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "QUERY: \"music streaming app\" -> encode, center, normalize\n-> 64 lookup tables x 256 floats (one per code byte):\n   table[b][v] = sum over the 8 bits of v of +-q[8b+j] / sqrt(512)\nscore(segment) = sum of 64 lookups = cos(query, sign vector)\nevery segment, in parallel, once per query\n(asymmetric: the query stays float, only segments are bits)",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1636190225,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "text": "QUERY: \"music streaming app\" -> encode, center, normalize\n-> 64 lookup tables x 256 floats (one per code byte):\n   table[b][v] = sum over the 8 bits of v of +-q[8b+j] / sqrt(512)\nscore(segment) = sum of 64 lookups = cos(query, sign vector)\nevery segment, in parallel, once per query\n(asymmetric: the query stays float, only segments are bits)",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "updated": 1792604917829,
